      "description": "At most one per page; its one action inverts to a white pill.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-feature\"><h3 class=\"ds-ftitle\">Plan something new.</h3><p class=\"ds-ftext\">Pick a time, invite the group, and Fairpoint finds the fair spot.</p><button class=\"ds-fbtn\">New hangout</button></section>",
      "css": ".ds-feature{padding:2rem;background:var(--fp-ink,#111);color:var(--fp-bg,#fff);border-radius:32px}.ds-ftitle{margin:0;font:800 2.25rem/1.05 Fraunces,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--fp-bg,#fff)}.ds-ftext{margin:.75rem 0 1.25rem;font:400 1.0625rem/1.5 \"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--fp-on-dark-muted,#c9c9c9)}.ds-fbtn{min-height:44px;padding:.7rem 1.4rem;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--fp-bg,#fff);color:var(--fp-ink,#111);font:700 1rem \"DM Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform 160ms cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1),background-color 160ms}.ds-fbtn:hover{background:var(--fp-surface,#f5f5f3)}.ds-fbtn:active{transform:scale(.97)}.ds-fbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fp-bg,#fff);outline-offset:3px}"
