  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "One Headline, One Pill",
    "overview": "Every Fairpoint screen says what it is for in a single big teal Fraunces headline that ends in a full stop, then offers one black pill to tap. Everything else steps back: white pages, soft grey panels and hairlines do the separating, and DM Sans carries everything that is read or tapped. The system was built for a friend who just tapped a group-chat link on a 375px phone and needs to know the next move in one glance.\n\nDensity is low and deliberate. Sections breathe; the page's single loud moment is the headline, and the single loud action is the black pill. Depth comes from tone (white against #F5F5F3), never from shadows. Colour is rationed: teal belongs to Fairpoint itself (wordmark, headlines, selected state, progress, done steps) and coral appears only as a dot or a tint when a deadline is live.\n\nThis is Direction C, pinned by the user from their own design canvas. It refuses busy dashboards of equal-weight cards and shadowed boxes.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "One teal Fraunces 800 headline per page, ending in a full stop.",
